# Agent Notes

Follow [.agents/notes/AGENTS.md](../../.agents/notes/AGENTS.md).

Path: `{lifecycle}/{class}/yyyy-mm-dd-slug.md`. Status line must match the folder. Alternatives considered is mandatory. Implemented notes use Decision and Consequences, never Proposal or Acceptance criteria. Archived notes are frozen.
